o trouble against sets or two pair. The best balance is to **call (0)** and see the river cheaply. This keeps you in the pot without overcommitting. Given the opponent’s aggression, they may bluff again on the river if a scare card appears, or you can fold then if outdrawn.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
